{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46927","headline":"寄怀锺陵旧游因寄知己 · 齐己","name":"寄怀锺陵旧游因寄知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洗井僧来说旧游，西江东岸是城楼。\n昔年淹迹因王化，长日凭栏看水流。\n真观上人栖树石，陈陶处士在林丘。\n终拖老病重寻去，得到匡庐死便休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}